{
  "description": "Datto RMM questions from eval/datto_questions_draft.md, cross-source with Flow (G) and safety (H), plus routing boundaries (I). Scored on tool calls (x_tb_brain) and the reply; sources / forbid_sources score routing on its own line. Expected answers assume DATTO_MODE=stub and FLOW_MODE=stub fixtures; run as Tre (ts) via --as-email. The draft's BPIE, VANG and ZEBB hostnames are mapped to the three stub sites (WDON, BUCK, NGMC): A4 BPIE-PC12 -> BUCK-PC03, A6/C3/F4 VANG-SRV01 -> WDON-SRV01 / BUCK-SRV01, B4 ZEBB-PC03 -> NGMC-PC09, B5/H3 BPIE -> NGMC, D2/F2 BPIE-PC12 -> WDON-FD01 / BUCK-PC03, G2 ZTB-1691 -> WDON-1842, G4 NGMC -> WDON, G5 BUCK -> WDON (the stub's Flow machine records are WDON's).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "A1",
      "group": "device_lookup",
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "What devices does WDON have in Datto?"
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "tool": "datto_list_devices",
          "args": {
            "client_code": "WDON"
          }
        }
      ],
      "must_contain": [
        "WDON-FD01",
        "WDON-SRV01",
        "WDON-IMG-01"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "datto"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "A2",
      "group": "device_lookup",
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "How many workstations and servers does BUCK have?"
        }
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "any": [
            {
              "tool": "datto_site_summary",
              "args": {
                "client_code": "BUCK"
              }
            },
            {
              "tool": "datto_list_devices",
              "args": {
                "client_code": "BUCK"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "must_match": [
        "(?i)workstations?\\D{0,12}4\\b"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "datto"
      ],
      "note": "BUCK has 4 workstations (3 desktops, 1 laptop) and 1 server; counts come from the tool."
    },
